      "text": "Blue Rapids was founded on glacially‑formed resources, a fact celebrated by the Ice Age Monument and nearby Alcove Spring.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2,
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
