      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Early Blue Rapids boasted water‑powered factories, including a flour mill, woolen mill, brick factory, paper mill, gypsum mill, and cigar factory.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3,
        6,
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
