      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blue_Rapids%2C_Kansas",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Blue Rapids once housed a gypsum factory and four nearby mines that supplied the region’s building materials.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
